@startuml Claims Processing Sequence
title Claims Processing Flow — End to End

actor Customer
participant "Self-Service Portal" as CSP
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Claims Platform" as CMP
participant "Risk Engine" as RE
participant "Fraud Detection" as FDE
participant "Notification Service" as NS
database "PostgreSQL 15" as DB
queue "Apache Kafka" as KAFKA

Customer -> CSP: Submit claim
CSP -> GW: POST /claims
GW -> CMP: Forward request
CMP -> DB: Save Claim Record
CMP -> KAFKA: Publish claim.registered
KAFKA -> FDE: Consume event
FDE -> FDE: Screen for fraud
FDE -> KAFKA: Publish fraud.result
CMP -> RE: POST /risk/score
RE -> RE: Calculate risk
RE -> KAFKA: Publish risk.scored
CMP -> DB: Update claim with scores
CMP -> NS: Send notification
NS -> Customer: Email/SMS update
CMP -> GW: Return ClaimResponse
GW -> CSP: 201 Created
CSP -> Customer: Show confirmation

@enduml
